WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.400 line:6% align:center
Title screen: Have You Tried Restarting? A first-person IT help desk game by Chit Thway.

00:03.400 --> 00:10.000 line:6% align:center
The player walks around the help desk office and sits down at their own PC.

00:10.000 --> 00:17.000 line:6% align:center
A remote support session opens a client's desktop, where the problem is fixed by clicking through Settings.

00:17.000 --> 00:27.500 line:6% align:center
A bench job: open the client's PC, find the fault, rewire it and boot-test it.

00:27.500 --> 00:30.800 line:6% align:center
The repaired PC is shipped back and the job is rated.

00:30.800 --> 00:34.000 line:6% align:center
Email jobs: reply to the client with branching choices.

00:34.000 --> 00:37.500 line:6% align:center
The day ends and the office is quiet at night.

00:37.500 --> 00:41.000 line:6% align:center
The quokka logo closes the trailer.
